{
  "containerClass" : "container pt-3",
  "html" : "<h3>Flex Grids</h3> \n<p><strong>Flexible Grid Containers</strong> & <strong>Flexible Grid Items</strong> are ways to layout content using any page designer component. <br><br>The Structure in Page Designer looks like this: <strong>Flexible Grid Container > Flexible Grid Item > Embedded Component > *<em>Any Component</em>*</strong> <br><br>Flex Grid Containers default to  12 columns for Desktops, 4 columns for Tablets and 2 columns for Mobile. <br><br> The number of columns can be set for the container as a whole and the grid items will fall into those preset columns. <br>A grid item can over-rule the set columns by selecting a column span per each grid item.<br><br> Resize the screen to see how each Flex Grid appears per breakpoint </p>"
}

